# claude remote-control servers, one per line. Apply changes with: claude-rc-sync
#
#   <name>  <path>  [spawn]  [extra flags for `claude remote-control`...]
#
# name   : service instance name / session name prefix (letters, digits, . _ -)
# spawn  : worktree (default) | same-dir | session   ("-" = default)
#          worktree falls back to same-dir when <path> is not a git repository
# extra  : e.g. --permission-mode acceptEdits   --capacity 4   --chrome
#
# The directory must be trusted in Claude Code first (run `claude` there once).
#
# my-secretary  ~/workspace/my-secretary
# my-app        ~/workspace/my-app        same-dir
